{"html": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405340/extras/69e4caae613b0ddf74d6aab32df9e87f.poster.avif?t=1760445338\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405340/extras/69e4caae613b0ddf74d6aab32df9e87f.webm?t=1760445338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405340/extras/69e4caae613b0ddf74d6aab32df9e87f.mp4?t=1760445338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>QUANTO TEMPO VOCÊ CONSEGUE SOBREVIVER?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Megabonk é um roguelike survival game onde você precisa enfrentar hordas de inimigos e bosses em mapas gerados aleatoriamente. Pegue loot pelo caminho, upe seu character, faça upgrade nas armas e sobreviva o máximo que puder! Até onde você chega?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405340/extras/f8e3d47202dd5b1144ae4ad8677721be.poster.avif?t=1760445338\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405340/extras/f8e3d47202dd5b1144ae4ad8677721be.webm?t=1760445338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405340/extras/f8e3d47202dd5b1144ae4ad8677721be.mp4?t=1760445338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>UPGRADE &amp; FIQUE OP</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Derrote inimigos e colete XP para subir de nível! Quanto mais inimigos você derrota, mais XP você ganha. Cada upgrade é random e com raridades diferentes, deixando cada run única!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405340/extras/84ca6d6ce147cf0028c0ac37cd3b7464.poster.avif?t=1760445338\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405340/extras/84ca6d6ce147cf0028c0ac37cd3b7464.webm?t=1760445338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405340/extras/84ca6d6ce147cf0028c0ac37cd3b7464.mp4?t=1760445338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>DESBLOQUEIE CHARACTERS, ARMAS &amp; ITEMS</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >240 quests dentro do jogo</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 characters com abilities únicas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70+ items diferentes com várias synergies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;10/10, eu recomendo&quot; – Monke</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405340/extras/ac375efb94712dc8442b27901a7e2a50.avif?t=1760445338\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>"}